{"type":"text","timestamp":1794372801211,"sessionID":"ses_e37145559ffetVKrfk7MW4vWAq","part":{"id":"prt_1c8f4129e001EBxyskTRhNMsVi","messageID":"msg_1c8f3fc36001a1XF8RyClq5P7U","sessionID":"ses_e37145559ffetVKrfk7MW4vWAq","type":"text","text":"Done. Built the full sensor dashboard.\n\n**Backend** (`backend/app.py`): Flask + SQLite (WAL, `./data/sensors.db`), auth with hashed passwords and bearer tokens, all `/api` endpoints with owner-only writes, newest-first readings with `total`/`limit`, server-set `recorded_at`, and SPA/asset serving.\n\n**Frontend** (React/TS + Tailwind v4 + Recharts): auth forms with signed-in state/sign-out, live sensor cards with relative timestamps (10s refresh), sensor detail page with line chart + readings table, and owner forms for registering/posting/deleting (with confirmation).\n\nVerified: typecheck, `npm ci && npm run build`, 50+ API checks, gunicorn with 2 workers, and data persistence across restart.","time":{"start":1794372801182,"end":1794372801186}}}
